{"name":"rico","description":"Rectified 24-cell (rectified icositetrachoron)","source":"topology_output/rico.json","format":"polychoron-modal/1","model":{"body":"thin-walled hollow 4D body: the cells are welded 3D plates of thickness h","equations":"Kirchhoff bending of each cell along its 4D normal, (h^3/12)[lam* (Lap w)^2 + 2 mu |grad grad w|^2], lam* = 2 lam mu/(lam+2mu); ridges fixed (thin-wall limit), hinge rotation continuous across ridges (welded)","method":"Ritz per cell with two bubbles: phi = (sum_f d_f^-2)^(-1/2), a smooth distance to the face planes, and b = prod_f tanh(d_f/delta); phi^2 x poly (zero slope at the faces: the interior) plus phi x poly and b x poly for the hinge rotations (near an edge they behave like r and r^2, the exact solution like r^(pi/alpha) in between). Soft walls: slopes p - 2, interior p; stiff walls resonating in the range: slopes 6, interior 4; the others: phi x poly slopes 6, interior 2 (see basis; polynomial_degree lists p for soft walls, the slope degree for stiff ones). Legendre-product polynomials, orthonormalised by QR; cell matrices per shape mapped by congruence; problem block-diagonalised by (Z2)^4 mirror symmetries (one block per character, assembled from one representative cell per orbit); hinge penalty beta = 1000 mu h^3 / l","polynomial_degree":{"cube":8,"cuboctahedron":8},"basis":{"cube":"both: slopes 6, interior 8","cuboctahedron":"both: slopes 6, interior 8"},"computed_up_to":"5 x f1 (plus the band reaching over it)","lambda_over_mu":1.0,"units":"circumradius R = 1, density rho = 1, shear modulus mu = 1 (shear wave speed c_s = 1); wall thickness h_ref = 0.06 R","frequency":"f_Hz = frequency * (h / h_ref) * c_s[m/s] / R[m]  (bending: f ~ h)","gains":"as in modal_output (mass-relative, per multiplet sum); mean = multiplicity (every mode bends all its mass); tangential = 0 and no vertex gains (membrane motion is not modelled, ridges and vertices are fixed)","rel_error":"indicator: change of the modes of two symmetr